      "content": "<h3>All Hashtable methods at a glance</h3>\n<p>Every method is <code>synchronized</code>.</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;\">\n<tr><th style=\"text-align:left;\">Method</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">What it does</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">Time</th></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>put(k, v)</strong></td><td>Add or replace a pair (no nulls)</td><td>O(1) average</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>get(k)</strong></td><td>Value for a key, or null if absent</td><td>O(1) average</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>remove(k)</strong></td><td>Delete a key and return its value</td><td>O(1) average</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>containsKey(k)</strong></td><td>Is the key present?</td><td>O(1) average</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>containsValue(v)</strong> / <strong>contains(v)</strong></td><td>Is the value present? (the same thing)</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>size()</strong> / <strong>isEmpty()</strong> / <strong>clear()</strong></td><td>Count, emptiness check, delete all</td><td>O(1) / O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>putIfAbsent, getOrDefault, replace, merge, compute...</strong></td><td>Java 8 Map methods (atomic here)</td><td>O(1) average</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>keys()</strong> / <strong>elements()</strong></td><td>Legacy Enumeration of keys / values</td><td>O(1) to create</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>keySet() / values() / entrySet()</strong></td><td>Live views for loops</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>putAll(map)</strong> / <strong>clone()</strong></td><td>Copy pairs / shallow copy</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>equals / hashCode / toString</strong></td><td>Compare and print</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n</table>"
